  "question": {
    "text": "For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Taking&nbsp;natural logarithm on both sides, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Differentiating both sides with respect to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math>&nbsp;(Using quotient rule)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math>.</p></blockquote>"
  }
